+# Wire Format
+
+The project's recorded decision is to use CBOR for wire serialisation. This decision superseded an earlier choice of msgpack and was confirmed in the decision config (`revoke-wire-format.json` read `"value": "cbor"`) before that config was later relocated out of this repository's tree; no subsequent record has changed the chosen format.
